 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "The value per kilogram of imports from EU27 countries increased from 0.51 euros in 2005 to 1.23 euros in 2025.",
  "This represents a rise of 138.7% over the 20-year period.",
  "In comparison, imports from non-EU27 countries started much higher at 11.86 euros per kilogram in 2005 and rose by 66.1% to 19.71 euros in 2025.",
  "The peak value for EU27 imports was 1.26 euros per kilogram in 2024, while non-EU27 imports peaked earlier in 2009 at 24.10 euros per kilogram.",
  "The data only includes trade rows where quantities are known, so some volumes and unit values are missing."
 ],
